{{!-- Security notice after a password change. Data: resetUrl --}}
{{> heading text="Your password was changed"}}
{{#> para}}The password for your {{site.name}} account was just changed.{{/para}}
{{#> para muted=true}}If this was you, there's nothing else to do.{{/para}}

{{#> callout tone="warning"}}<strong>Wasn't you?</strong> Reset your password right away and reply to this email so we can secure your account.{{/callout}}

{{> button url=resetUrl label="Reset my password"}}
